# PowerCore UX prefs (tip)

When building or fixing PowerCore UI (sidebars, scroll/wheel, focus, composers,
history rails, panels), load **powercore-ux-prefs** and read:

`powercore-ops/design/powercore-ux.preferences.md`

On operator UX corrections (“wheel should always scroll X”), fix code **and**
CAPTURE into that index (`PX-###`).

Do not invent competing scroll/focus behavior when `PX-001` (pointer-over scroll
host) already covers it.
